{"3897080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dimenshot", "steam_appid": 3897080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dimenshot</strong> is a FPS that combines the boomer shooter genre with a core melee-focused experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlike games like <i>Doom</i> that rely heavily on gunplay, here firearms are used purely for support to close the distance, while your primary melee weapons are your main source of damage and health. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your core melee weapons and seamlessly chain your attacks by combining them with temporary firearms scavenged directly from your fallen enemies.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/813cf4e0cafacd06ccdcd83b9f3f02ef.poster.avif?t=1786872299\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/813cf4e0cafacd06ccdcd83b9f3f02ef.webm?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/813cf4e0cafacd06ccdcd83b9f3f02ef.mp4?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your blind vengeance across unique, tailor-made levels designed around the Seven Deadly Sins, each packed with distinct thematic enemies built to break you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/94f4e8e6f29c45b