er genre with a core melee-focused experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlike games like <i>Doom</i> that rely heavily on gunplay, here firearms are used purely for support to close the distance, while your primary melee weapons are your main source of damage and health. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your core melee weapons and seamlessly chain your attacks by combining them with temporary firearms scavenged directly from your fallen enemies.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/813cf4e0cafacd06ccdcd83b9f3f02ef.poster.avif?t=1786872299\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/813cf4e0cafacd06ccdcd83b9f3f02ef.webm?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/813cf4e0cafacd06ccdcd83b9f3f02ef.mp4?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your blind vengeance across unique, tailor-made levels designed around the Seven Deadly Sins, each packed with distinct thematic enemies built to break you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/94f4e8e6f29c45b6d0784492593b4e8c.poster.avif?t=1786872299\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/94f4e8e6f29c45b6d0784492593b4e8c.webm?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/94f4e8e6f29c45b6d0784492593b4e8c.mp4?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single theme brings the pain with brutal boss fights, relentless mini-bosses, and a massive roster of fresh enemy types to tear through.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/504c4cf119dbb668c883df391051f0d8.poster.avif?t=1786872299\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/504c4cf119dbb668c883df391051f0d8.webm?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897080/extras/504c4cf119dbb668c883df391051f0d8.mp4?t=1786872299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>SINS OF -̶̵̵̵̸̶̴̷̴̷̶̸̴̵̷̸̸̴̸̶̸̴̵̴̴̵̷̴̴̴̴̸̶̴̴̵̵̵̴̴̶̵̴̷̵̷̶̷̴̵̶̴̴̶̷̶̸̷̶̸̴̴̴̴̷̸̴̶̴̶̷̴̶̶̴̴̶̷̴̶̸̷̷̶̷̴̸̸̷̸̸̵̷̴̵̴̸̵̴̴̴̶̶̸̴̶̷̴̵̴̵̵̸̵̴̸̶̸̴̶̴̸̸̷̸̶̴̵̵̷̴̸̶̸̴̷̸̶̶̸̷̶̴̴̸̵̸̸̵̷̸̸̴̵̴̸̸̶̴̷̸̸̴̸̶̴̸̵̸̶̶̸̸̷̶̶̸̸̴̴̸̴̸̸̴̶̴̴̷̵̷̷̵̵̸̶̸̶̷̸̸̴̸̸͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͠͠͞͝͡͡͝͠͞͝͠͠͡͝͝͠͝͡͞͞͞͡͞͠͞͞͞͞͞͝͝͝͡͡͡͠͝͞͞͡͠͞͞͡͝͡͡͝͝͞͞͠͝͠͝͝͠͝͞͠͡͠͞͞͞͠͝͠͝͠-̶̵̵̵̸̶̴̷̴̷̶̸̴̵̷̸̸̴̸̶̸̴̵̴̴̵̷̴̴̴̴̸̶̴̴̵̵̵̴̴̶̵̴̷̵̷̶̷̴̵̶̴̴̶̷̶̸̷̶̸̴̴̴̴̷̸̴̶̴̶̷̴̶̶̴̴̶̷̴̶̸̷̷̶̷̴̸̸̷̸̸̵̷̴̵̴̸̵̴̴̴̶̶̸̴̶̷̴̵̴̵̵̸̵̴̸̶̸̴̶̴̸̸̷̸̶̴̵̵̷̴̸̶̸̴̷̸̶̶̸̷̶̴̴̸̵̸̸̵̷̸̸̴̵̴̸̸̶̴̷̸̸̴̸̶̴̸̵̸̶̶̸̸̷̶̶̸̸̴̴̸̴̸̸̴̶̴̴̷̵̷̷̵̵̸̶̸̶̷̸̸̴̸̸͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͠͠͞͝͡͡͝͠͞͝͠͠͡͝͝͠͝͡͞͞͞͡͞͠͞͞͞͞͞͝͝͝͡͡͡͠͝͞͞͡͠͞͞͡͝͡͡͝͝͞͞͠͝͠͝͝͠͝͞͠͡͠͞͞͞͠͝͠͝͠ -̶̵̵̵̸̶̴̷̴̷̶̸̴̵̷̸̸̴̸̶̸̴̵̴̴̵̷̴̴̴̴̸̶̴̴̵̵̵̴̴̶̵̴̷̵̷̶̷̴̵̶̴̴̶̷̶̸̷̶̸̴̴̴̴̷̸̴̶̴̶̷̴̶̶̴̴̶̷̴̶̸̷̷̶̷̴̸̸̷̸̸̵̷̴̵̴̸̵̴̴̴̶̶̸̴̶̷̴̵̴̵̵̸̵̴̸̶̸̴̶̴̸̸̷̸̶̴̵̵̷̴̸̶̸̴̷̸̶̶̸̷̶̴̴̸̵̸̸̵̷̸̸̴̵̴̸̸̶̴̷̸̸̴̸̶̴̸̵̸̶̶̸̸̷̶̶̸̸͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͘͠͠͞͝͡͡͝͠͞͝͠͠͡͝͝͠͝͡͞͞͞͡͞͠͞͞͞͞͞͝͝͝͡͡͡͠͝͞͞͡͠͞͞͡͝͡͡͝͝͞͞͠͝͠͝͝͠͝͞